  "從規劃文件到可維護的網站": "From Planning Documents to a Maintainable Site",
  "專案進行中，我遇到三個直接改變後續做法的問題：文件與網站脫節、大幅修改造成跑版，以及修改流程缺少明確檢查。": "During the project, three issues changed my approach: documentation drifted from the site, broad changes caused layout problems, and the change process lacked clear checks.",
  "轉折一：設計文件和實際網站脫節": "Turning Point 1: Documentation Drifted From the Live Site",
