  "之後我改為先盤點實際網站，再依盤點結果更新文件與規則。": "I changed the process to audit the live site first, then update documentation and rules based on what was actually in use.",
  "轉折二：未先確認影響範圍，大幅修改意外破壞原有畫面": "Turning Point 2: Broad Changes Broke Existing Layouts Before Their Impact Was Reviewed",
  "早期我曾讓 AI 一次修改多個案例頁，部分單頁版型太早被整理成共用方案，造成邊框重疊、間距跑掉和手機版水平溢出。": "Early on, I had AI modify several case-study pages at once. Some page-specific layouts were moved into shared patterns too early, causing stacked borders, broken spacing, and mobile horizontal overflow.",
  "這次經驗讓我改為在動手前先確認修改範圍，以及哪些內容適合共用、哪些應留在單一頁面。": "After that, I began reviewing the scope before making changes and deciding which patterns should be shared and which should remain page-specific.",
  "轉折三：將修改與檢查拆成明確階段": "Turning Point 3: Separating Changes and Checks Into Clear Stages",
  "之後我把工作拆成現況盤點、小範圍修改與畫面檢查，確認結果後才保留版本紀錄。": "I separated the work into reviewing the current state, making scoped changes, and checking the interface before saving a version snapshot.",
  "這套做法用來控制修改範圍；實際改善幅度仍待後續紀錄。": "This approach is intended to keep changes within a defined scope; the extent of any improvement still requires further records.",
