  "把重複使用的顏色、間距和字級集中管理，先讓各頁採用同一組基礎規則，不急著建立共用元件。": "Centralize repeated colors, spacing, and typography so pages use the same base rules before creating a shared component.",
  "外框和排列方式重複，但內容每次不同": "Frames and layout repeat, but content changes each time",
