  "重複的顏色與間距集中管理；固定版型可共用外框；結構和行為都穩定重複時，再整理成共用元件。": "Centralize repeated colors and spacing, share stable layout frames, and create a shared component only when both structure and behavior repeat consistently.",
  "集中管理設計值（design tokens）：把顏色、字級、間距等設定放在同一處，讓不同頁面沿用相同規則。": "Centralized design values (design tokens) keep color, typography, and spacing settings in one place so pages can follow the same rules.",
  "元件使用規則（component contract）：說明元件適合承載的內容、支援的狀態與不適用的情境。": "Component usage rules (component contracts) define supported content, states, and situations where a component should not be used.",
  "固定外框、內容可替換（slot-based composition）：共用排列方式，但讓各頁放入自己的內容。": "A stable frame with replaceable content (slot-based composition) shares the layout while allowing each page to provide its own content.",
  "相同需求穩定出現多次後，再評估是否整理成共用元件（Rule of Three）。": "Consider a shared component after the same need appears consistently several times (Rule of Three).",

